      "fullAudioScript": "PART 1: DIALOGUE\nNarrator: Listen to the conversation between two students. Choose the best answer A, B, or C. You will listen twice.\n\nNam: Hi Mai, are you preparing for our upcoming school English project?\nMai: Hello Nam! Yes, I am researching interesting facts about English learning methods.\nNam: Where shall we meet to practice our presentation together?\nMai: We can meet in the school library this Sunday morning at eight o'clock.\nNam: Does practicing in pairs help us improve our pronunciation and confidence?\nMai: Certainly! Working together allows us to correct mistakes and learn effectively.\n\nPART 2: MONOLOGUE\nNarrator: Listen to the recording. Decide whether the statements are True (A) or False (B). You will listen twice.\n\nCommunity service is an extremely beneficial activity for secondary school students in Dong Yen. Last month, more than three hundred volunteers enthusiastically joined the green school campaign. They planted trees, collected discarded plastic containers, and painted murals along the school corridors. These practical actions not only protect the surrounding environment but also foster unity, compassion, and responsibility among the younger generation.",
